    {
      "id": 24,
      "title": "getPayload build phases (EL)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "p95 of each getPayload build phase (eip8142_build_phase_seconds): fill_transactions (EVM exec + tx selection), encode (RLP BAL+txs into payload blobs), build_bundle (KZG commitments + EIP-7594 cell proofs). Sums to ~the getPayload latency, so this attributes the 2s budget by phase instead of inferring it. Amber 1s / red 2s = the getPayload warning/deadline (whole-call, not per-phase). Builder-local ($node).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 46
